 ("p", "Each process is a pair of files with the same number and revision: a Word **process description** (owner, scope, suppliers, inputs, outputs, customers, measures and a narrative for each step) and a **process model file** that ONE draws as swimlanes. Each step names its role, the document sections it relies on, the controls it performs and the records it creates. The model also carries simple timing and cost fields so that, in future, ONE can animate and simulate how work flows."),
