 ("ext", "IOGP Report 511, OMS in practice: a supplement to Report 510 (2014), © IOGP and IPIECA. IOGP Report 456, Process safety — recommended practice on key performance indicators."),
 ("ext", "ISO/DIS 29501, ISO/DIS 29502 and ISO 29011, operating management systems (under development). ISO 31000, Risk management — Guidelines. ISO/IEC 19510, Business Process Model and Notation (BPMN 2.0)."),
 ("ext", "APQC Process Classification Framework (PCF). API RP 580 and 581, risk-based inspection; API RP 584, integrity operating windows; API 579-1, fitness-for-service; ISO 14224, reliability and maintenance data; NORSOK D-010 and ISO 16530-1, well integrity; API MPMS, AGA Report 9 and ISO 5167, hydrocarbon measurement; IEC 61511, safety instrumented systems; IEC 62682, alarm management."),
 ("p", "*Acme Caribbean Energy is a fictional company created by Cynmark Systems Limited for demonstration purposes. All names, assets and figures are invented.*"),
